Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.31,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}tu  tulu  tu  baby
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.52,0:04:51.65,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}这份心情  仅用言语无法形容
